From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:34:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] soc: mediatek: mt6797-consys: declare the ROM patches it
 loads

The driver requests two named ROM patch files. Declare them, so tools that
build an initramfs or a firmware list can find them.
---
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
index 5e39e9f8f..aa3830e6e 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/mediatek/mt6797-consys.c
@@ -2855,3 +2855,5 @@ module_platform_driver(mt6797_consys_driver);
 
 MODULE_DESCRIPTION("MediaTek MT6797 CONSYS owner");
 MODULE_LICENSE("GPL");
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("mediatek/mt6797/ROMv3_patch_1_1_hdr.bin");
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("mediatek/mt6797/ROMv3_patch_1_0_hdr.bin");
-- 
2.43.0

